//x.com/emma_muse_news/status/2121380567623336420"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121379972002746368"]}, "author_id": "866148566", "created_at": "2026-11-13T23:09:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121379979816738850"], "id": "2121379979816738850", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta just put Muse in Chrome, so the agent can sit in a side panel while you browse. \ud83e\udded\n\nPer Meta's official help page, the Muse Chrome Extension places Muse in Chrome's side panel. You can chat from any page, and Muse browses using your personal Chrome, with its tabs kept in https://t.co/qomf01FBrI", "url": "https://x.com/nxtday/status/2121379979816738850"}, {"author_id": "2016340376341155840", "created_at": "2026-11-13T23:09:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121379900049535157"], "id": "2121379900049535157", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2016340376341155840", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121379157888184699", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok all these Agent wallet idea is funny lol wtf Meta Muse, chatgpt wallet and much more i thinking one of this becomes main stream and i can build Agent Wallet on iOS lol", "url": "https://x.com/karbonx6/status/2121379900049535157"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121304151535562752"]}, "author_id": "223214091", "created_at": "2026-11-13T23:09:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121379833104220658"], "id": "2121379833104220658", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse Ember benchmark results - more intelligence per dollar than Claude Haiku 5.5 or GPT-6 Luna https://t.co/NkQ8wuApAF", "url": "https://x.com/janaavula/status/2121379833104220658"}, {"author_id":